nd{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the matrix represents a *horizontal* shear with a shear factor of $10.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062085/state.json" "file_sha256" "85a68e41755b99591fd81bb18a2bc8610a0a1447bbb6747262ca07e0cc856680"} {"question" "q-12044" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062085/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "b71482df4e5a7ceaa2278712357f7b8769bb9dc5141cdda2dfbfcd1200ebf66d"} {"question" "q-12044" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062085/state.json" "file_sha256" "85a68e41755b99591fd81bb18a2bc8610a0a1447bbb6747262ca07e0cc856680"} {"question" "q-12044" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "A horizontal shear with a shear factor of $10$"] ["text" "A stretch of scale factor $10$ in the $x$-direction"] ["text" "A stretch of scale factor $10$ in the $y$-direction"] ["text" "A vertical shear with a shear factor of $1$"] ["text" "A vertical shear with a shear factor of $10$"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062085/state.json" "file_sha256" "85a68e41755b99591fd81bb18a2bc8610a0a1447bbb6747262ca07e0cc856680"} {"question" "q-12044" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "A horizontal shear with a shear factor of $10$"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062085/state.json" "file_sha256" "85a68e41755b99591fd81bb18a2bc8610a0a1447bbb6747262ca07e0cc856680"} {"question" "q-8092" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "val